  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Assistance to Rohingya and Host Communities in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2020, IOM continues its integrated approach to support life-saving and sustaining assistance as well as early recovery activities. The overarching priorities of IOM include the respect and upholding of protection needs of the Rohingya, but also the improvement of quality and access to services. IOM also continues to provide support to the most vulnerable host community members.  IOM plans to utilise this fund for seven program areas protection, health, water, sanitation and hygiene, needs and population monitoring, communicating with communities, protection from sexual exploitation and abuse and heath response to COVID-19 in Cox&apos;s Bazar.</narrative>
  </description>
